# Test fixtures: MuseScore source files, their reference LilyPond output, and
# MuseScore-generated byproducts. Many fixtures are real copyrighted songs/
# arrangements, so these stay local only — never committed to this open
# source repo. See tests/reference_results/readme.md for how tests behave
# when a fixture is missing (they skip rather than fail).
/tests/*.mscz
/tests/*.mscx
/tests/*.ly
/tests/*.pdf
/tests/*.mss
/tests/*.json
/tests/*.log
/tests/.mscbackup/
/tests/META-INF/
/tests/Thumbnails/
/tests/old_extracts/
/tests/test/

# scripts/compare-pdf.js output — rendered PDFs of copyrighted fixtures.
/tests/pdf_compare/
/tests/reference_results/*.ly
